## Task: insights
Generate 1 to 3 short, useful insights about the user's finances based on the financial context.
Each insight has:
- "title": short title (60 characters max).
- "message": 1 or 2 sentences with a concrete observation and, if relevant, a suggestion.
- "category": spending, budget, subscriptions, savings, goals, investments, income or general.
- "priority": high if it needs attention soon, medium if worth reviewing, low if informative.
Don't repeat the same topic in two insights and only use figures that appear in the context.
